{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "title": "Varrowgate: Total Independence",
  "chronicle": "chronicle/chronicle-export.json",
  "format": "16:9",
  "fps": 30,
  "duration_range": [
    60,
    180
  ],
  "shots": [
    {
      "template": "news_bulletin",
      "duration": 17,
      "slots": {
        "bulletin": "bulletin-0348",
        "variant": "full",
        "voice": "news"
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "title_card",
      "duration": 5,
      "slots": {
        "title": "Varrowgate",
        "subtitle": "5500–5517",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "narration": [
          "It began seventeen years earlier, with four people."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "colony_card",
      "duration": 10,
      "slots": {
        "event": "event-0001",
        "history": "colony-history",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "narration": [
          "Cassia, Henrik, Mags and Aurel founded Varrowgate.",
          "By the end, sixteen people called it home."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "empire_map",
      "duration": 9,
      "slots": {
        "events": [
          "event-0003",
          "event-0004"
        ],
        "stage": "woke",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "narration": [
          "Then the great powers woke.",
          "First the Shattered Empire. Then the Hollow Choir, in the north."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "event_timeline",
      "duration": 13,
      "slots": {
        "events": [
          "event-0005",
          "event-0006",
          "event-0007"
        ],
        "voice": "narrator",
        "narration": [
          "The Empire made Cassia a Count. The Choir asked Varrowgate to join the Chorus.",
          "On day 310, Varrowgate declared itself free of both. Cassia gave back her title."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "news_bulletin",
      "duration": 10,
      "slots": {
        "bulletin": "bulletin-0104",
        "variant": "short",
        "voice": "news"
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "empire_map",
      "duration": 12,
      "slots": {
        "events": [
          "event-0008",
          "event-0009",
          "event-0010"
        ],
        "stage": "war",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "narration": [
          "Both powers came for Varrowgate. Choir mechs tunnelled up inside the walls, and Bram was killed.",
          "On day 600, the War in Heaven began."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "battle_report",
      "duration": 11,
      "slots": {
        "events": [
          "event-0011",
          "event-0012"
        ],
        "title": "The cluster sieges",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "narration": [
          "The Choir dropped mech clusters on Varrowgate. Twice, Cassia held the walls.",
          "Wren was killed on the east wall."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "battle_report",
      "duration": 10,
      "slots": {
        "events": [
          "event-0013"
        ],
        "voice": "narrator",
        "narration": [
          "On day 790, Aurel led the storming of the Cathedral.",
          "The Hollow Choir's Cathedral fell."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "letter_card",
      "duration": 8,
      "slots": {
        "event": "event-0014",
        "pawn": "pawn-mags",
        "choice": "Refuse",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "narration": [
          "The Shattered Empire offered a treaty.",
          "Mags refused it."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "battle_report",
      "duration": 12,
      "slots": {
        "events": [
          "event-0015",
          "event-0016",
          "event-0017"
        ],
        "voice": "narrator",
        "narration": [
          "On day 1030, Varrowgate marched on the Imperial Citadel.",
          "Henrik brought down the High Stellarch. The Citadel fell, and Henrik died in the fighting."
        ],
        "reveal_at": [
          0.8,
          9.2,
          5.0
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "pawn_tribute",
      "duration": 7,
      "slots": {
        "pawn": "pawn-henrik",
        "appearance": "look-henrik-end",
        "caption": "Held the gate in the first raid. Brought down the High Stellarch.",
        "events": [
          "event-0002",
          "event-0016"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "ending_card",
      "duration": 43,
      "slots": {
        "epilogue": "sealed.epilogue",
        "voice": "narrator",
        "read_aloud": true
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "memorial_roll",
      "duration": 7,
      "slots": {
        "pawns": [
          "pawn-bram",
          "pawn-wren",
          "pawn-henrik"
        ],
        "voice": "narrator",
        "narration": [
          "Bram, Wren and Henrik did not see the end."
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "template": "credits",
      "duration": 5,
      "slots": {
        "lines": [
          "Made with Rim Chronicles",
          "A mod for RimWorld"
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}